:::text id=txt_hdr_s6 at=top-left width=80% height=80 offsetX=80 offsetY=56 preset=title align=left color=text fontSize=38
# Debugging Huy — Known Issues & Support Plan
:::

:::shape id=card_b1 at=top-left width=530 height=210 offsetX=80 offsetY=160 kind=rect fill=surface borderRadius=12
:::

:::icon id=icn_b1 at=top-left width=36 height=36 offsetX=104 offsetY=184 name=help-circle size=32 color=#06B6D4
:::

:::text id=txt_b1 at=top-left width=480 height=130 offsetX=104 offsetY=228 preset=body align=left color=text fontSize=15
**Bug #1: Questions**  
Ask a lot of questions when a problem is not fully understood before committing. Provide clear context and explain how it is relevant to the business, product, or team.
:::

:::shape id=card_b2 at=top-left width=530 height=210 offsetX=670 offsetY=160 kind=rect fill=surface borderRadius=12
:::

:::icon id=icn_b2 at=top-left width=36 height=36 offsetX=694 offsetY=184 name=battery-charging size=32 color=#06B6D4
:::

:::text id=txt_b2 at=top-left width=480 height=130 offsetX=694 offsetY=228 preset=body align=left color=text fontSize=15
**Bug #2: Energy**  
Respond slowly when running on low energy. Give time to recover, still feel free to ask for faster response if urgent.
:::

:::shape id=card_b3 at=top-left width=530 height=210 offsetX=80 offsetY=400 kind=rect fill=surface borderRadius=12
:::

:::icon id=icn_b3 at=top-left width=36 height=36 offsetX=104 offsetY=424 name=repeat size=32 color=#06B6D4
:::

:::text id=txt_b3 at=top-left width=480 height=130 offsetX=104 offsetY=468 preset=body align=left color=text fontSize=15
**Bug #3: Over-excited**  
Tend to be incoherent when getting over-excited. Give time to let things sink in, and echo back what you hear if possible.
:::

:::shape id=card_b4 at=top-left width=530 height=210 offsetX=670 offsetY=400 kind=rect fill=surface borderRadius=12
:::

:::icon id=icn_b4 at=top-left width=36 height=36 offsetX=694 offsetY=424 name=alert-triangle size=32 color=#06B6D4
:::

:::text id=txt_b4 at=top-left width=480 height=130 offsetX=694 offsetY=468 preset=body align=left color=text fontSize=15
**Bug #4: Pushing hard**  
Sometimes push self and people too hard. Explain if it's not working or if energy is better spent in other ways.
:::
